1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,200
Now slide wave two out of step.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,570
The phase difference, phi, grows.

3
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:09,114
On the right, the two amplitudes add like arrows, head to tail.

4
00:00:09,114 --> 00:00:17,343
At a phase difference of pi, half a cycle, the crests of one sit on the troughs of the other, and the sum is zero.

